paths. Do not prepare or run any VASP or NEB calculations.\\n\\n## Final Answer\\nCompleted the **MACE-only fast screening** for CO on **bcc Fe(110)** with no VASP/NEB work.\\n\\n**Preliminary adsorption-energy ranking** (`E_ads = E(slab+CO) - E(clean slab) - E(CO_gas)`, eV; more negative = stronger adsorption):\\n1. `bridge_1`: **-0.036147117614746094 eV**\\n2. `hollow_0`: **-0.035063743591308594 eV**\\n3. `bridge_0`: **-0.033751487731933594 eV**\\n4. `ontop_0`: **-0.031065940856933594 eV**\\n\\n**Reference energies used**\\n- Clean Fe(110) slab: **-125.70799255371094 eV** — `mace_runs/ref_relax_slab/mp-13_h110_t0_2x2_fix2layers/summary.json`\\n- CO(g): **-14.743287086486816 eV** — `mace_runs/ref_relax_co/CO/summary.json`\\n\\n**Key output paths**\\n- Bulk Fe: `retrieval/mp/fe_bulk/mp-13.vasp`\\n- Constrained screening slab: `slabs/fe110_raw/mp-13_h110_t0_2x2_fix2layers.vasp`\\n- CO reference input: `references/co_ref/input/CO.vasp`\\n- Enumerated sites: `adsorption/fe110_co/sites.json`\\n- Adsorption batch + metadata: `adsorption/fe110_co/batch`\\n- Adsorbate MACE relaxations: `mace_runs/ads_relax_fe110_co`\\n- Ranked summaries: `reports/`\\n\\nThis ranking is a **preliminary MACE-only triage result**; differences are very small (~0.005 eV across the set), so site ordering should be treated as tentative and sensitive to slab model, starting geometry/orientation, and the chosen pretrained potential.\\n\"}","role":"user"}],"model":"google/gemini-3-flash-preview","reasoning_effort":"minimal","stream":false,"temperature":1.0}
